SIFT_CARD_MAX_PREDS	the most items (columns, keys, filters, masks, operations) one scan node handles: a statement with more is not planned by the scan and PostgreSQL plans it, the rows are the same
SIFT_CLAUSE_MAX_PREDS	the most items (columns, keys, filters, masks, operations) one scan node handles: a statement with more is not planned by the scan and PostgreSQL plans it, the rows are the same
