SIFT_CLUSTER_MAX_COLS	the most items (columns, keys, filters, masks, operations) one scan node handles: a statement with more is not planned by the scan and PostgreSQL plans it, the rows are the same
SIFT_CLUSTER_MAX_NDV	tuning bound of an algorithm (memory, batch or radix size, load factor): it changes the speed or memory of a plan, not its rows
